" boards it is the USB connector. So just connect to the USB device with your"
" favourite serial program (the baudrate doesn't matter)."
msgstr ""
"上传示例后，您可以通过连接控制台来查看输出。控制台是什么取决于主板类型。对于 Pixhawk 主板，控制台就是 USB "
"接口。只需使用您喜欢的串口程序连接 USB 设备（波特率不重要）。"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-the-example-sketches.rst:46
#: a229d83117dd46a286d16b2c18f0cffd
