msgstr "要启动草图，直接运行它："

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-the-example-sketches.rst:75
#: c521a243bd024e408d1e8f0aec2c1d79
msgid "Understanding the example sketch code"
msgstr "理解示例草图代码"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-the-example-sketches.rst:77
#: c15da5bd968e4d19bce68cc00cc75c02
msgid ""
"When you are reading the example sketch code (such as the `GPS_AUTO_test "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_GPS/examples/GPS_AUTO_test/GPS_AUTO_test.cpp>`__"
" code) you will notice a few things that may seem strange at first:"
msgstr ""
"在阅读示例草图代码（例如 `GPS_AUTO_test "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_GPS/examples/GPS_AUTO_test/GPS_AUTO_test.cpp>`__"
" 代码）时，您会注意到一些初看可能感觉奇怪的地方："

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-the-example-sketches.rst:81
#: 0d26ac8cc3cc4170a6c454af34757367
msgid "it declares a 'hal' variable as a reference"
msgstr "它将「hal」变量声明为引用"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-the-example-sketches.rst:82
#: 84560ce3a2294ebc81d4eca2dd6eec1d
msgid "the code is quite rough and not well commented"
msgstr "代码相当粗糙，注释不足"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-the-example-sketches.rst:83
#: 4b2f49fd40a34bac88b341a20d006562
msgid "the setup() and loop() functions"
msgstr "setup() 和 loop() 函数"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-the-example-sketches.rst:86
#: 5daf0d1e0e444851928dc59d1cfdb894
msgid "The hal reference"
msgstr "hal 引用"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-the-example-sketches.rst:88
#: c799cfffabce49ed8ca3102e792d5846
msgid ""
"Every file that uses features of the AP_HAL needs to declare a hal "
"reference. That gives access to a AP_HAL::HAL object, which provides access "
"to all hardware specific functions, including things like printing messages "
"to the console, sleeping and talking to I2C and SPI buses."
msgstr ""
"每个使用 AP_HAL 功能的文件都需要声明一个 hal 引用。它提供对 AP_HAL::HAL "
"对象的访问，该对象提供所有硬件特定功能，包括向控制台打印消息、休眠以及与 I2C 和 SPI 总线通信等。"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-the-example-sketches.rst:94
#: 3abf49e1f5eb41b8940539ba1ab6e919
msgid ""
"The actual hal variable is buried inside the board specific AP_HAL_XXX "
"libraries. The reference in each file just provides a convenient way to get "
"at the hal."
msgstr "实际的 hal 变量隐藏在特定主板的 AP_HAL_XXX 库内部。每个文件中的引用只是提供了一种访问 hal 的便捷方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-the-example-sketches.rst:98
#: 220aa88992044fc9991189247242f00b
msgid "The most commonly used hal functions are:"
msgstr "最常用的 hal 函数包括："

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-the-example-sketches.rst:100
#: 8581a8bcbb964958a0327c0c15f86154
msgid "hal.console->printf() to print strings"
msgstr "hal.console->printf()，用于打印字符串"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-the-example-sketches.rst:101
#: ae9e1799207f4733aacb51879b2ae79f
msgid "AP_HAL::millis() and AP_HAL::micros() to get the time since boot"
msgstr "AP_HAL::millis() 和 AP_HAL::micros()，用于获取自启动以来的时间"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-the-example-sketches.rst:103
#: 771c22b483a24449a1b2affb4e8ad253
msgid ""
"hal.scheduler->delay() and hal.scheduler->delay_microseconds() to sleep for "
"a short time"
msgstr "hal.scheduler->delay() 和 hal.scheduler->delay_microseconds()，用于短暂休眠"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-the-example-sketches.rst:105
#: c4d1146e71e34c5eb8a8b75184c2b8b2
msgid ""
"hal.gpio->pinMode(), hal.gpio->read() and hal.gpio->write() for accessing "
"GPIO pins"
msgstr "hal.gpio->pinMode()、hal.gpio->read() 和 hal.gpio->write()，用于访问 GPIO 引脚"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-the-example-sketches.rst:107
#: a333fc3dad0e43ea93332af004d2111a
msgid "I2C access via hal.i2c"
msgstr "通过 hal.i2c 访问 I2C"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-the-example-sketches.rst:108
#: 6b4a692680a54e31994f33f2e5bd48d8
msgid "SPI access via hal.spi"
msgstr "通过 hal.spi 访问 SPI"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-the-example-sketches.rst:110
#: c83403231c4e44198d33893985327f51
msgid ""
"Go and have a look in the libraries/AP_HAL directory now for the full list "
"of functions available on the HAL."
msgstr "现在请查看 libraries/AP_HAL 目录，了解 HAL 上所有可用函数的完整列表。"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-the-example-sketches.rst:114
#: 46bf206aa1dc44cd8f0a3855f0730fc0
msgid "The setup() and loop() functions"
msgstr "setup() 和 loop() 函数"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-the-example-sketches.rst:116
#: 6d56d48d23fe452388f53798dc7c767b
msgid ""
"You will notice that every sketch has a setup() function and loop() "
"function. The setup() function is called when the board boots. The actual "
"call comes from within the HAL for each board, so the main() function is "
"buried inside the HAL, which then calls setup() after board specific startup"
" is complete."
msgstr ""
"您会注意到每个草图都有 setup() 函数和 loop() 函数。setup() 函数在主板启动时被调用。实际调用来自每块主板的 HAL 内部，因此 "
"main() 函数隐藏在 HAL 内部，在主板特定启动完成后调用 setup()。"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-the-example-sketches.rst:122
#: 5c29940d59fe4361a0b6683019b6d770
msgid ""
"The setup() function is only called once, and typically initialises the "
"libraries, and maybe prints a \"hello\" banner to show it is starting."
msgstr "setup() 函数只被调用一次，通常用于初始化库，以及打印「hello」横幅表示程序正在启动。"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-the-example-sketches.rst:125
#: 01d909b1ee3a462e8c836113e8a970f1
msgid ""
"After setup() is finished the loop() function is continuously called (by the"
" main code in the AP_HAL). The main work of the sketch is typically in the "
"loop() function."
msgstr ""
"setup() 完成后，loop() 函数会被持续调用（由 AP_HAL 中的主代码调用）。草图的主要工作通常在 loop() 函数中完成。"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-the-example-sketches.rst:129
#: 8706b6ad5c934ae6a9303fe648bb74bf
msgid ""
"Note that this setup()/loop() arrangement is only the tip of the iceberg for"
" more complex boards. It may make it seem that ArduPilot is single threaded,"
" but in fact there is a lot more going on underneath, and on boards that "
"have threading (such as Pixhawk and Linux based boards) there will in fact "
"be lots of realtime threads started. See the section on understanding "
"ArduPilot threading below."
msgstr ""
"请注意，对于更复杂的主板，这种 setup()/loop() 结构只是冰山一角。它可能让人觉得 ArduPilot "
"是单线程的，但实际上底层运行着更多内容，在支持线程的主板上（如 Pixhawk 和基于 Linux 的主板），实际上会启动大量实时线程。请参阅下文关于 "
"ArduPilot 线程的章节。"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-the-example-sketches.rst:137
#: 689479f7439748dd980841148a489bbd
msgid "The AP_HAL_MAIN() macro"
msgstr "AP_HAL_MAIN() 宏"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-the-example-sketches.rst:139
#: 6299c03fde70430eb72bb5366913708d
msgid "You will notice a extra line like this at the bottom of every sketch:"
msgstr "您会注意到每个草图底部都有类似这样的额外一行："

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-the-example-sketches.rst:145
#: aab0dad866bc49279c8baf24cf8b99d9
msgid ""
"That is a HAL macro that produces the necessary code to declare a C++ main "
"function, along with any board level initialization code for the HAL. You "
"rarely have to worry about how it works, but if you are curious you can look"
" for the #define in the AP_HAL_XXX directories in each HAL. It is usually in"
" AP_HAL_XXX_Main.h."
msgstr ""
"这是一个 HAL 宏，用于生成声明 C++ main 函数所需的代码，以及 HAL "
"的任何主板级初始化代码。您很少需要关心它的工作原理，但如果您感到好奇，可以在每个 HAL 的 AP_HAL_XXX 目录中查找 #define，通常在 "
"AP_HAL_XXX_Main.h 中。"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-the-example-sketches.rst:152
#: d4a6cb270094426aab7480befcbf2cfd
msgid "Rough Example code"
msgstr "粗糙的示例代码"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-the-example-sketches.rst:154
#: d80ead394f4246d7b4deb00d5eb023c4
msgid ""
"You will notice that the example sketches are quite rough, and badly "
"commented. This is your opportunity to make a contribution to the code! As "
"you read through the example sketches and explore how they work add some "
"comments to the code to explain the APIs and then :ref:`submit a pull "
"request <submitting-patches-back-to-master>` so others can benefit from your"
" study."
msgstr ""
"您会注意到示例草图相当粗糙，注释也很少。这正是您为代码做贡献的机会！在阅读示例草图并探索其工作原理时，为代码添加一些注释来解释 API，然后 "
":ref:`提交一个 PR <submitting-patches-back-to-master>`，让其他人也能从您的学习中受益。"
